ligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the equation of the tangent hyperplane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w-0 & =(x-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,-1,1)+(y+1)\\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,-1,1)+(z-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,-1,1) \\\\ w & =2(x-1)-2(y+1)-2(z-1) \\\\ w & =2x-2-2y-2-2z+2 \\\\ -2x+2y+2z+w+2 & =0 \\\\ 2x-2y-2z-w-2 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407546 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407548 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407546 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0eadd7d5-26a1-573f-b533-83cfbfb498b9" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407546 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186342103 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407547 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407550 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407547 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2b51d9b4-6f4d-519a-946f-18af30633fc4" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407547 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323970 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407548 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "32cd70ef-6665-5a4e-a0ab-b70e5098e66f" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407548 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186265754 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407549 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407546 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407549 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "536015a5-6f9f-597a-ae46-2c87559ba2b3" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407549 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186342099 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407550 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186407549 #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407550 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "93f5b13c-94e0-5cb3-a51d-2c9c6f5ed98b" #edb/ref 17592186045585] [17592186407550 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186407545 #edb/ref 17592186045585]}
